  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">2025 Contribution - The Cowboy Ventures under AADP</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Under this Africa Agri-food Development Programme (AADP) grant, The Cowboy Ventures will conduct a feasibility study that will engage local smallholder farmers to analyse the food systems value addition potential in cassava crops. Investigate the technological and quality requirements to add the production of Cassava (Tapioca) Flour and Industrial Starch to their current production facilities that processes Gari Flour. In addition, the study will assess both domestic and international market potential.</narrative>
  </description>
